on</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoon</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interleukin 4 receptor expression and growth inhibition of gastric carcinoma cells by interleukin 4</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1992</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>6059</fpage><lpage>6065</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||52|6059||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1394231</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Myers</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Yasumura</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Suminami</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirabayashi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><name><surname>Lotze</surname><given-names>MT</given-names></name><name><surname>Whiteside</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Growth stimulation of human head and neck squamous cell carcinoma cell lines by interleukin 4</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>1996</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>127</fpage><lpage>135</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Clin Cancer Res||2|127||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9816099</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nelms</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Keegan</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Zamorano</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryan</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Paul</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The IL-4 receptor: signaling mechanisms and biologic functions</article-titl